(13656, 'WA078', 'Ao Rei que vem', 'Lift Up Your Heads', 'Steve Fry', '{t:78.Ao Rei que vem}\n{st:Lift Up Your Heads (Steve Fry)}\n\n[G]Ao  [Bm7]Rei  [G/B]que [C]vem [Am7]\n[D]Ergue o [Am7]Teu o[D]  - [G]lhar  [C/G]  [D/G] \n[G]De jo[Am7]e    - [G/B]lhos [C]a  [D7/C]do  - [C]rai [Dsus]can - [D/C]tai   [G2/B]  [Am7]  [D]\n[G]À [Bm7]sua ma[G/B]jes - [C]tade [Am7]\n[D]Daí to  [Am7]do_o [D]lou - [G]vor  [C/G]  [D/G]\n[G]Puro e [Dm7]san - [G]to, [C]sempre [D7/C]dan - [C]do\n[Am7]Gló - [G/B]ria ao [Dsus]rei     [D]   [C/D]dos [G]reis\n\nAlbum: Hosanna Music All Hail King Jesus  Kent Henry\n@1974 Birdwing Music', '{t:78.Ao Rei que vem}\n{st:Lift Up Your Heads (Steve Fry)}\n\nAo  Rei  que vem \nErgue o Teu o  - lhar     \nDe joe    - lhos a  do  - rai can - tai       \nÀ sua majes - tade \nDaí to  do_o lou - vor    \nPuro e san - to, sempre dan - do\nGló - ria ao rei        dos reis\n\nAlbum: Hosanna Music All Hail King Jesus  Kent Henry\n@1974 Birdwing Music', NULL, 'H8gwHJJZyrA', 1, 'Hosanna Music', '', 0, '©1974 Birdwing Music', 1, 1, '2024-04-24 17:32:54', '2024-04-24 17:32:54'),
