 \n-->Coro  2x\n\nSolo: \n                              \n                         \n\n-->Sem ti estou  \n-->Coro  2x\n\nFINAL: \n          \n\nAlbum: Toque no altar - Toque no altar\n\n', NULL, 'OZG0Z6EXyv8', 1, 'Davi Sacer, Toque no Altar', '', 0, '© 2003 Trazendo a Arca', 1, 1, '2024-04-24 17:32:54', '2025-03-29 09:46:40'),
